<div class="container mt-5 pt-5">

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-dark">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted">Undergraduate Admissions 2026 — University of Engineering & Technology Taxila</p>
        <div style="width: 90px; height: 5px; background: var(--uet-accent); margin: 25px auto; border-radius: 3px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">

            <!-- FAQ Accordion -->
            <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q1">
                            How can I apply for Undergraduate Admissions at UET Taxila?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Visit the official admission portal <strong>admissions.uettaxila.edu.pk</strong> and click on “MY UET”. Register using your CNIC/Form-B number, fill the online application form, and deposit the Rs. 4000 application processing fee through HBL Konnect or Internet Banking.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q2">
                            What is the Application Processing Fee and how do I pay it?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <!-- <div class="accordion-body">
                            The application processing fee is <strong>Rs. 4,000</strong>. It can be paid through HBL Konnect App, HBL Internet Banking, or any HBL branch by selecting “UET Taxila Admission Processing”.
                        </div> -->
                       <div class="accordion-body">
                            The application processing fee is <strong>Rs. 4,000</strong>. It can be paid by using following methods after generating Admission Processing Fee voucher from admission portal,<br/>
                            Payment Methods: <br />
                            i.   HBL Mobile App: Go to payments, Select 1-Bill Invoice, Enter Consumer Number (Prefix+Voucher No) and Process payment. ,take screen shoot of successfull transaction.<br />
                           <!--  ii.  Jazz Cash App:-  Go to Corporate payments in Other payment & Services Section, Select 1-Bill, Enter Voucher Number (Prefix+Voucher) Proceed payment,take screen shoot of successfull transaction,.<br />  -->
                            ii. Bank Of Punjab Branch:- Print Admission Processing Fee Voucher, Visit the BOP branch submit the fee, upload the paid fee challan/ Paid Fee Proof to admission Portal.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q3">
                            What are the eligibility criteria for admission?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            You must have passed F.Sc (Pre-Engineering) / ICS / DAE (relevant field) or equivalent with at least <strong>60% marks</strong> for Engineering programs and <strong>50% marks</strong> for BS Math/ Physics /Computer Science / Engineering Technology programs. You must also appear in the TCAT/ECAT/Equivalent test.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q4">
                            What is TCAT/ECAT/Equivalent and when is the test held?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            TCAT/ECAT/Equivalent (Engineering University Admission Test) is conducted by UET Lahore. Registration usually starts in February/March. Register at <a href="https://admission.uet.edu.pk" target="_blank">admission.uet.edu.pk</a>.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q5">
                            How is the merit calculated?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Merit Formula:<br>
                            • HSSC-I / DAE (1st and 2nd Year)/ Equivalent = 50%<br>
                            • TCAT/ECAT/Equivalent / Entry Test = 33%<br>
                            • SSC / Matric = 17%
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q11">
                             Can HSSC Pre-Medical students apply for Engineering programs?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q11" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Yes, HSSC Pre-Medical students can apply for Engineering programs. However, they must qualify the ECAT/ TCAT / or an equivalent 
                            test with Mathematics as an additional subject/combination. Applicants are also required to provide the result of the Additional 
                            Mathematics paper or the Condensed Mathematics course, as per the admission requirements of the respective university.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q6">
                            What is the fee structure for the first semester?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            • Regular (Subsidized) ≈ Rs. 104,800 (without hostel)<br>
                            • Partial-Subsidized (S & X categories) ≈ Rs. 339,800+<br>
                            Exact fee is mentioned in the prospectus and on the fee structure page.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q7">
                            Is hostel facility available?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Limited hostel seats are available for male students on merit basis. Female students have very limited accommodation. Hostel dues are approximately Rs. 36,000 – 40,000 1<sup>st</sup> semester.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q8">
                            What documents are required at the time of admission?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Original + attested photocopies of 
                            1. SSC
                            2. HSSC/DAE / Equivalent
                            3. TCAT/ECAT/Equivalent result card
                            4. CNIC/Form-B
                            5. Father’s CNIC
                            6. Domicile
                            7. recent passport size photographs
                            For More Information kindly read the propectus available online to check the needed documents.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q9">
                            Can DAE students apply for admission?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q9" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Yes, DAE holders in relevant technologies from PBTE are eligible to apply in Engineering and Engineering Technology programs. They must appear in TCAT/ECAT/Equivalent.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q10">
                            When are the merit lists announced?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q10" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Multiple merit lists are displayed after the TCAT/ECAT/Equivalent result. You must regularly check your “MY UET” account on the admission portal.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                 
                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q11">
                            What undergraduate programs are offered?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q11" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <strong>Engineering:</strong> Civil, Electrical, Mechanical, Computer, Software, Telecommunication, Electronics, Industrial, Environmental, Mechatronics<br>
                            <strong>Computer Science:</strong> BS Computer Science<br>
                            <strong>Engineering Technology (Afternoon):</strong> Cyber Security, Software<br>
                            <strong>Basic Sciences:</strong> BS Physics, BS Mathematics
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q12">
                            How can I contact the Admission Office?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q12" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
