                            <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f88d9fd6999c95918b8b919796b88d9d8c8c9980919499d69d9c8dd68893">[email&#160;protected]</a><br>
                            <strong>Phone:</strong> +92-51-9047400–412<br>
                            Office Timing: Monday to Friday (9:00 AM – 3:00 PM)
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                 <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q13">
                            What steps need to follow after merit list?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="q13" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Students who have been offered admission need to complete the following steps: </br>
                                            1. Pay the semester fee to secure your seat.</br>
                                            2. After paying the semester fee, upload the paid challan form on admission portal, scrutiny team will verify the uploaded documents.</br>
                                            3. Candidate needs to check his/her email and admission portal  regularly for re-upload documents/ upcoming merit lists.</br>
                                            4. Wait for the original document submission plan, it will be available in the end of July or start of August.</br>
                                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

